  "limitations": [
    "The formal whole-model performance result covers only batch-one P513 with exact C512 tiling and one generated token.",
    "The 170 MiB scratch is request-scoped and conditionally allocated; concurrent-request memory scaling and continuous batching are not implemented.",
    "One baseline run observed a 103.625 MiB transient free-memory decrease above the 64 MiB observation tolerance, but it fully recovered and no run reported a persistent drop.",
    "One baseline load phase was about twice as slow as the other loads; load time is excluded from measured Prefix and TTFT samples, so this record makes no startup-latency claim.",
    "The hybrid route writes and rereads a full 170 MiB BF16 weight image per projection; a fused native large-M NVFP4 GEMM remains necessary for the longer-term upper bound."
